                      (        forth.asm):01142         * A candidate for a word code address must meet the following criteria:
                      (        forth.asm):01143         * ((Y U>= #EBUFS) AND (Y U< #THEEND)) OR ((Y U>= #WDICSPC) AND (Y U< DICEND)).
