                      (        forth.asm):04063         * Y: pointer to ud2 (ARG_V/q in the C code).
                      (        forth.asm):04064         * E: Inner loop index (i in the C code).
                      (        forth.asm):04065         * F: Outer loop index (j in the C code).
                      (        forth.asm):04066         *
                      (        forth.asm):04067         * We save U to the system stack and use it to point to a scratch area allocated
                      (        forth.asm):04068         * from the system stack that will contain the 4 bytes (double cell) ultimately
                      (        forth.asm):04069         * holding the result (MSB first, what else?).
                      (        forth.asm):04070         *
                      (        forth.asm):04071         * System stack structure:
                      (        forth.asm):04072         * ,S    Result scratch area (Result MSB)
                      (        forth.asm):04073         * 2,S   Result scratch area (Result LSB)
